# Research spike run outputs (large, frequently regenerated, contain LLM output)
specs/research-spike-runs/

# Big-spec spike (Epic 09) run outputs — same reasoning, plus some files exceed
# GitHub's 100MB-per-file hard cap. The audit markdowns (_manual-coverage-audit*.md)
# and the deterministic _precheck.json are committed; only the LLM-output JSONs
# are ignored. Reproducible via `npx tsx scripts/spike/run-arch.ts ...`.
specs/big-spec-runs/*.json
!specs/big-spec-runs/_precheck.json
scripts/spike/eval/cache/

# API-Corpus-Mining (Welle M / M2a) — 253 MB of public-vendor OpenAPI specs.
# Reproducible via `node scripts/spike/download-corpus.mjs`. The structured
# `patterns.json` extract is committed, only the raw corpus is ignored.
scripts/spike/data/healthy-corpus/
